// EXPECT: [E087]
// A parameter sized by a module constant, `a u8[K]`, is a slice whose length the callee ASSUMES
// is K, and every call must establish it. The call site resolved a literal, a parameter and
// `p.len` only, emitted nothing for a constant, and the callee still assumed it: called with a
// 2-element array, `g` proved `a[3]` and read past the array (ASan: stack-buffer-overflow).
K usize = 4
func g(a u8[K]) u8 { return a[3] }
func main() i32 {
    var b u8[2] = [1, 2]
    return g(b) as i32
}
